      We can see that when α changes from 0.1 to 0.6, the overall trend of MI coefficient
  varies the same over time. Meanwhile, the larger α is, the more influential the influ-
  encer is in its active start year. When α=0.7, artist’s MI has the greatest influence in
                    号




  it’s active start year, and then gradually decreases. This situation should be avoided
  because it does not conform to the lag of the actual music popular trend. When α=0.6,
  the MI coefficient of the influencers’active start year is already 0.97. We have made
       信




  many attempts around 0.6 and found that the MI coefficient changes become very sen-
  sitive and the trend is easy to be destroyed, which is not a good thing for different data
  sets. Therefore, the attenuation coefficient α should be set between 0.1 to 0.6 where the
      微




  model is relatively stable.




